@EventApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194

### Список всех событий
GET {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events
Accept: application/json

### Событие по id
GET {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Создать событие
POST {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test event",
  "description": "some description",
  "startAt": "2026-01-01T10:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-01-01T12:00:00"
}

### Создать событие без title (ожидаем 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "no title",
  "startAt": "2026-01-01T10:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-01-01T12:00:00"
}

### Создать событие с endAt раньше startAt (ожидаем 400)
POST {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad range",
  "startAt": "2026-01-01T12:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-01-01T10:00:00"
}

### Обновить событие
PUT {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated event",
  "description": "updated",
  "startAt": "2026-01-02T10:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-01-02T12:00:00"
}

### Удалить событие
DELETE {{EventApi_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000